# Design comments vs discussion

When the user sends design comments, implementation notes, Figma fixes, or “внеси эти изменения”:

- Apply them in the repo immediately.
- Commit and push to the preview branch (`cursor/home-player-figma-layout` unless told otherwise).
- After push, paste this preview URL in chat: https://next-level-git-cursor-home-player-figma-layout-next-level-1999.vercel.app/
- Do not send hashed unique Vercel URLs.

When the user marks something as discussion-only (“отдельный момент для обсуждения”, “не в прод”, “просто поразмышлять”):

- Answer in chat only.
- Do not change code, tokens, rules, or Git for that part.
